  "verdict": {
    "statement": "The guard is evaluated on the real stack and closes at INFO: the bodyless GET emits the skip event at DEBUG and none at INFO, the POST's body is scanned and a SQLi body is detected in request_body, and the user-agent that carries the command in command position is detected in header:user-agent while the one that carries the same substring mid-word is not detected at all.",
